WEBVTT

00:00:01.070 --> 00:00:02.060
<i>Hasegawa Kouta!</i>

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:03.890
<i>Mizuno Yuu!</i>

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:05.650
<i>Yoshino Shunsuke!</i>

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:07.250
<i>Nishimiya Ryo!</i>

00:00:07.930 --> 00:00:09.360
<i>Minamoto Seiichirou!</i>

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:11.770
<i>Lots of things have happened,</i>

00:00:11.770 --> 00:00:14.270
<i>but the Sanrio Boys are all together!</i>

00:00:17.390 --> 00:00:18.500
Hasegawa-kun.

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:21.430
Is that a new release?

00:00:21.430 --> 00:00:23.360
Y-Yeah, it is.

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:26.220
This one is cute, too.

00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:29.190
Hey, let's go look at the merch soon, too.

00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:36.420
Everyone in class has gotten pretty
used to you liking Sanrio, too.

00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:39.840
I'm still not used to it though.

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:42.080
But you're not trying to hide it?

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:45.060
Yeah, even though it's a bit embarrassing.

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:46.650
Hase!

00:00:46.650 --> 00:00:48.210
Let's go to the cafeteria!

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:49.520
Sorry, Macchi.

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:51.580
I promised Yuu and the
others I'd join them today.

00:00:51.580 --> 00:00:54.580
You barely hang out with us at all lately.

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:57.410
Come on, I'll treat you to one
of these for dessert.

00:00:57.410 --> 00:01:01.040
Macchi, Pompompurin isn't
the custard pudding dessert.

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:02.240
Seriously?!

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:06.500
<b>Factoid: Pompompurin is a male Golden Retriever.</b>

00:01:02.240 --> 00:01:06.500
I thought he was supposed to be some kind
of pudding fairy or personified pudding!

00:01:06.730 --> 00:01:09.250
Umm, anyway, I'm really sorry guys!

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:10.540
Hey, Hase!

00:01:10.790 --> 00:01:13.350
We were dumped by Hase again!

00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:18.760
Student Council Room

00:01:27.840 --> 00:01:29.040
Pardon me!

00:01:31.780 --> 00:01:32.580
Yo.

00:01:33.060 --> 00:01:33.860
Hey.

00:01:35.130 --> 00:01:35.980
Hi.

00:01:36.430 --> 00:01:37.490
You made it.

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:14.340
Miraculous Holiday

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:15.630
My new Melody-chan lunch box!

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:17.520
And when you lift the lid...

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:19.090
Melody-chan is inside, too!

00:03:21.410 --> 00:03:23.880
Did you make that, Mizuno? It's incredible.

00:03:23.880 --> 00:03:26.210
I guess it's pretty impressive.

00:03:26.590 --> 00:03:30.300
Anyway, President, I said you could
call me by my first name, didn't I?

00:03:30.300 --> 00:03:31.310
You're right, you did.

00:03:31.820 --> 00:03:35.690
Yuu, I don't mind if you all call
me by my first name, too.

00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:38.770
Well, that might be a bit awkward
with you being president and all...

00:03:39.230 --> 00:03:40.150
I see.

00:03:45.610 --> 00:03:46.460
Want some?

00:03:47.980 --> 00:03:51.000
I was just thinking that you really
eat a lot, Yoshino-san.

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:53.890
Do I? I have to eat lunch
after morning practices

00:03:53.890 --> 00:03:55.210
and I eat two times more than this.

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:56.500
You eat two lunches?

00:03:56.900 --> 00:04:00.220
You should eat more if you want
to get any bigger, Ryo-chan.

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:01.630
Please leave me be.

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:04.850
Also, stop calling me Ryo-chan, Mizuno-san.

00:04:04.850 --> 00:04:07.200
Call me Yuu-kun then?

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:08.140
No way.

00:04:08.300 --> 00:04:09.910
You're not cute at all!

00:04:09.910 --> 00:04:13.060
And I treated you to that crepe
on the way home the other day!

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:15.100
Th-That has nothing to do with this.

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:18.360
Want some?

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:21.080
That doesn't mean I want something sweet!

00:04:23.140 --> 00:04:24.290
What's wrong, Kouta?

00:04:24.290 --> 00:04:25.740
N-Nothing.

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:29.910
It's silly, but I was just wondering
if it's really okay for us to eat here.

00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:33.340
There's no one else other than me
right now, so don't worry about it.

00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:38.400
Besides, I want other students to come 
visit the student council room more often.

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:41.310
Well, it's pretty unusual
for regular students to go

00:04:41.310 --> 00:04:43.650
to the staff room or student council room.

00:04:43.650 --> 00:04:44.750
Really?

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:47.140
It's not that unusual to eat your
food wherever, right?

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:50.060
That's just your sports-player
mentality that you can eat quietly

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:53.310
in a room stained with the sweat
of you and your teammates.

00:04:54.830 --> 00:04:58.280
You're welcome to come hang out
anytime I'm not working in here.

00:04:59.130 --> 00:05:01.010
That includes you, too, Nishimiya.

00:05:01.010 --> 00:05:02.850
Huh? O-Okay.

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:05.440
Oh, that's right.

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:09.100
Would you rather I called you by your
first name like Yuu and the others?

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:13.240
Nishimiya is fine.

00:05:13.240 --> 00:05:15.890
I would rather you called me that.

00:05:16.430 --> 00:05:18.730
Okay, then I'll do that.

00:05:18.730 --> 00:05:19.530
Sure.

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:22.170
Would you look at that ladies?

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:25.190
There's a world of difference in his
attitude from how he is with us.

00:05:25.190 --> 00:05:28.720
But Ryo invited us to chat
with him on Line recently

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:30.580
like he did with the President, didn't he?

00:05:30.580 --> 00:05:34.120
Ryo-chan will read only my messages
without responding sometimes though.

00:05:34.120 --> 00:05:36.370
Your way of getting involved
with others is relatively annoying.

00:05:36.370 --> 00:05:38.270
And you're relatively relentless Shushu!

00:05:38.660 --> 00:05:42.500
I just want to talk about
Sanrio with a new friend.

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:44.700
But I'm just annoying.

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:47.610
I-It's not that bad.

00:05:51.820 --> 00:05:53.570
Do you all have a minute?

00:05:53.570 --> 00:05:54.450
Oh, sorry.

00:05:57.700 --> 00:05:59.880
Starting today, huh? Understood.

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:02.330
Did something happen?

00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:03.630
Yes,

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:07.850
I just received word that the regular planning
of the school festival begins today.

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:10.630
But the school festival is in the fall, right?

00:06:10.630 --> 00:06:12.910
Until recently we started
planning in the spring.

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:15.060
Fall will be here before you know it, Kouta.

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:16.850
The school festival.

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:26.530
<b>June</b>

00:06:16.850 --> 00:06:18.460
What's your club going to do, Shushu?

00:06:18.460 --> 00:06:20.510
Well, I think we're passing this year.

00:06:20.510 --> 00:06:23.020
All the seniors are focused on the summer.

00:06:23.020 --> 00:06:24.660
What about you, Ryo-chan?

00:06:24.660 --> 00:06:26.530
I told you not to call me that.

00:06:27.100 --> 00:06:29.530
Anyway, I'm not in any clubs.

00:06:29.530 --> 00:06:31.870
The library assistants might
do something though.

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:33.000
That's something.

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:34.830
Kouta and I are part of the going-home club,

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:37.640
so we won't be much help. Sorry, President.

00:06:37.640 --> 00:06:39.060
What are you saying?

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:41.150
The classes will also have displays.

00:06:41.150 --> 00:06:44.420
Besides, individual participation on
a volunteer basis is allowed as well.

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:46.920
So we can participate on our own?

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:47.850
Yes,

00:06:47.850 --> 00:06:51.210
if there's anything you'd like to do,
don't hesitate to let me know.

00:06:51.630 --> 00:06:53.690
Something we want to do, huh?

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:57.350
Did you have something you
wanted to talk about, President?

00:06:58.090 --> 00:07:00.770
Right, I actually have a proposal for you guys.

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:03.440
A proposal?

00:07:04.720 --> 00:07:07.470
I was hoping it might
deepen our friendship a bit.

00:07:12.710 --> 00:07:14.160
Welcome back, Hase.

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:15.410
I'm back, Tsucchi.

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:17.770
Hase!

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:19.960
Let's hang out this Sunday!

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:22.660
Let's go! I wanna go! You'll come right? Right?

00:07:22.660 --> 00:07:26.740
Sorry, I'm going to be hanging out with Yuu,
the President and the others on Sunday.

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:30.180
Hase you idiot!

00:07:30.180 --> 00:07:33.840
I give up! Damn it!

00:07:30.330 --> 00:07:33.500
Fifth period is about to start, Macchi!

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:38.980
You've really been expanding who you
hang out with compared to before, Hase.

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:43.300
That seems to be the reason
that I've upset Macchi though.

00:07:43.700 --> 00:07:45.260
Don't worry, don't worry.

00:07:45.260 --> 00:07:49.030
I think you're doing better now.
You've seemed much happier.

00:07:50.490 --> 00:07:52.490
Have I really looked like it?

00:07:59.340 --> 00:08:01.120
I'm off.

00:08:16.060 --> 00:08:18.270
Sanrio Puroland!

00:08:18.270 --> 00:08:20.430
Oh yeah, this is Kitty-san's...

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:22.350
It's the real thing! That's so awesome!

00:08:22.350 --> 00:08:24.960
Yeah, it is! It's my first time seeing it.

00:08:24.960 --> 00:08:27.200
Man, I'm so excited!

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:29.720
You've been here before though?

00:08:29.720 --> 00:08:31.930
I only went once as a kid.

00:08:31.930 --> 00:08:33.700
It's the same as it being my first time.

00:08:36.230 --> 00:08:38.940
Hey, let's all take a photo
together to commemorate this!

00:08:38.940 --> 00:08:39.990
Okay!

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:43.220
I'll take it then, since I come
to Puroland all the time.

00:08:43.220 --> 00:08:45.390
You should be in it, too.

00:08:45.390 --> 00:08:46.680
Even if you come here a lot,

00:08:46.680 --> 00:08:49.240
this is the first time the five
of us have come together, right?

00:08:49.240 --> 00:08:50.780
That's true.

00:08:50.780 --> 00:08:53.480
Ah! Um, excuse me!

00:08:55.630 --> 00:08:57.550
Would you take a picture of us?

00:08:58.380 --> 00:09:00.190
Your face is too close.

00:09:00.190 --> 00:09:01.810
Get a bit closer, President.

00:09:01.810 --> 00:09:02.740
Okay.

00:09:02.740 --> 00:09:06.090
Well, I'm actually pretty nervous about this.

00:09:06.090 --> 00:09:07.840
Okay, please take the photo!

00:09:07.840 --> 00:09:10.520
Ready? Say Melody!

00:09:17.380 --> 00:09:19.470
Wow, amazing!

00:09:20.170 --> 00:09:22.180
It really is all Sanrio.

00:09:22.180 --> 00:09:23.970
Look, over there!

00:09:24.510 --> 00:09:25.470
Cinnamoroll!

00:09:25.470 --> 00:09:26.950
It's huge.

00:09:26.950 --> 00:09:30.420
It's there to celebrate
Cinnamoroll's 15th anniversary.

00:09:30.910 --> 00:09:33.970
There's a Cinnamoroll
anniversary area up there as well.

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:36.620
What is it, Yuu?

00:09:36.620 --> 00:09:40.800
I mean, your eyes are sparkling
so much it's adorable, President.

00:09:41.690 --> 00:09:43.360
Right, Ryo-chan?

00:09:43.360 --> 00:09:45.850
D-Don't drag me into it!

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:46.230
Stop it, Yuu.

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:47.110
Ow!

00:09:49.350 --> 00:09:50.800
Hey, what're you doing?!

00:09:50.800 --> 00:09:53.730
I told you, your meddling is a bit annoying.

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:55.240
Sorry.

00:09:56.310 --> 00:09:57.740
Th-Thanks.

00:09:57.740 --> 00:10:00.530
Owie... you brute!

00:10:04.800 --> 00:10:07.120
Jeez, you're always like that Shushu.

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:09.160
Yuu, sorry.

00:10:09.770 --> 00:10:12.290
I'm just the annoying senpai after all.

00:10:13.140 --> 00:10:17.220
<i>Is Yuu trying to get Ryo to fit in with us?</i>

00:10:17.220 --> 00:10:20.310
Now, let the fun times begin!

00:10:20.310 --> 00:10:21.860
Why are you directing things?

00:10:21.860 --> 00:10:24.340
Because otherwise we'll waste our time.

00:10:24.340 --> 00:10:25.850
Well, I guess that's true,

00:10:26.150 --> 00:10:27.370
but I don't think I like it.

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:52.710
Right?

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:52.710
Perfect

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:52.710
It looks good on you

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:52.710
I get it,

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:52.710
Cute

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:52.710
<b>Of course
 it does.</b>

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:52.710
Murmur,
 murmur

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:44.470
Wow, it's so big!

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:47.310
There's limited edition Puroland goods, too.

00:11:47.310 --> 00:11:49.620
I guess I'll just have
to get my un-cute sister

00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:52.690
some cute Melody-chan 
goods as a present then.

00:11:50.070 --> 00:11:51.210
Amazing.

00:11:52.990 --> 00:11:57.070
Maybe I'll get some Kitty-san
candy for my teammates.

00:11:57.070 --> 00:12:01.210
It's okay to look around for ideas, but
it's better to buy things on our way out.

00:12:01.210 --> 00:12:02.110
Okay.

00:12:01.210 --> 00:12:02.110
Got it.

00:12:02.760 --> 00:12:05.130
I wonder what my older sisters would like?

00:12:05.560 --> 00:12:07.430
You're so nice, Ryo.

00:12:09.170 --> 00:12:11.090
That's not what I was going for at all.

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:15.010
Did I say something wrong?

00:12:15.740 --> 00:12:16.880
It's only been a little while,

00:12:17.480 --> 00:12:22.020
but Nishimiya is trying to face
himself and those around him.

00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:25.240
This is thanks to all of you, as well.

00:12:25.240 --> 00:12:27.560
Did I do anything?

00:12:29.720 --> 00:12:30.770
I get it.

00:12:32.710 --> 00:12:35.880
I was saved by you being like that, too.

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:44.530
This Purin key chain is so cute.

00:12:44.850 --> 00:12:48.400
I've never seen that hat before.
Is it a Puroland limited edition?

00:12:48.400 --> 00:12:50.410
That's his parade costume.

00:12:51.310 --> 00:12:53.650
It's definitely a Puroland
limited edition item.

00:12:53.970 --> 00:12:56.110
That's just what you were looking for.

00:12:56.110 --> 00:12:59.670
It's cute, and personal appearance
is important for boys, too.

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:01.330
Personal appearance?

00:13:01.330 --> 00:13:02.460
He means this.

00:13:03.180 --> 00:13:04.730
Oh, it's a mirror?

00:13:04.730 --> 00:13:06.270
I didn't realize at all.

00:13:06.270 --> 00:13:07.390
That's pretty cool.

00:13:07.620 --> 00:13:09.450
Then why don't we all buy one?

00:13:09.450 --> 00:13:12.810
It's a Puroland limited edition and
we can commemorate our visit.

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:14.350
Not a bad idea.

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:16.440
If you say so, then I don't mind.

00:13:16.780 --> 00:13:18.610
Okay then, it's settled!

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:26.140
We all have one.

00:13:32.560 --> 00:13:34.850
Oh, it's almost time.

00:13:34.850 --> 00:13:37.680
12:30. Okay, let's go.

00:13:37.680 --> 00:13:39.550
Where are we going?

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:41.380
It's obvious.

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:43.270
To save a spot!

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:52.350
Okay.

00:13:52.820 --> 00:13:54.210
We've secured a good spot.

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:57.210
Now, to wait until it starts at 1 o'clock.

00:13:57.210 --> 00:13:59.480
We have to wait another 30 minutes?

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:01.810
Take a good look around, Yuu.

00:14:01.810 --> 00:14:02.440
Huh?

00:14:03.910 --> 00:14:05.870
Lots of people are gathering.

00:14:07.130 --> 00:14:10.820
And everyone seems...

00:14:14.140 --> 00:14:16.900
President, is something going to start here?

00:14:17.230 --> 00:14:18.350
Well...

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:21.910
You could say it's a miracle.

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:24.210
A miracle?

00:14:26.030 --> 00:14:30.720
<i>At that moment, I couldn't understand
what President was saying at all.</i>

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:32.980
<i>but...</i>

00:14:37.580 --> 00:14:42.080
In the beautiful and peaceful Strawberry
Kingdom, there was a Strawberry King.

00:14:43.210 --> 00:14:49.360
The king longed for everyone to live together
in harmony with compassionate hearts.

00:14:50.730 --> 00:14:55.870
One day, the king traveled to Puroland...

00:14:52.480 --> 00:14:54.790
<i>That was definitely a miracle.</i>

00:14:57.900 --> 00:14:59.670
<i>The Miracle Gift Parade.</i>

00:15:00.720 --> 00:15:06.130
<i>The hugely popular Puroland show where
all the Sanrio friends appear together.</i>

00:15:18.610 --> 00:15:24.360
<i>Everyone has three hearts with
love, compassion, and harmony.</i>

00:15:25.350 --> 00:15:28.330
<i>They brought those three
hearts with them to Puroland</i>

00:15:28.330 --> 00:15:30.610
<i>to have a fun parade with everyone.</i>

00:15:46.610 --> 00:15:50.420
<i>Suddenly the three Queens of Darkness
appeared in the midst of the parade.</i>

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:53.830
<i>The Queens of Darkness tried
to steal the light from everyone,</i>

00:15:54.950 --> 00:15:58.370
<i>but in the end they're defeated.</i>

00:15:59.850 --> 00:16:03.460
<i>I thought it was such a simple story.</i>

00:16:06.740 --> 00:16:08.920
<i>But, I was wrong.</i>

00:16:08.920 --> 00:16:11.530
Wait! Don't destroy them!

00:16:13.430 --> 00:16:15.660
<i>I was honestly surprised.</i>

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:17.660
<i>But...</i>

00:16:18.030 --> 00:16:20.480
Our hearts are all together!

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:25.330
Ours and the Queens'!

00:16:26.800 --> 00:16:27.700
That's why...

00:16:29.040 --> 00:16:34.670
I want to believe we can be friends
with the Queens of Darkness!

00:16:37.070 --> 00:16:39.100
<i>What Kitty was suggesting...</i>

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:43.830
<i>In a sense, it was far more difficult
than just destroying the Queens.</i>

00:16:44.890 --> 00:16:47.250
<i>I thought there was no way they could do it.</i>

00:16:50.280 --> 00:16:55.410
Let's send our hearts of compassion
and harmony to the Queens of Darkness!

00:16:56.090 --> 00:16:57.910
<i>But Kitty wasn't alone.</i>

00:16:59.310 --> 00:17:02.520
<i>She had her friends.</i>

00:17:04.430 --> 00:17:10.560
<i>We can be happy just by being together</i>

00:17:10.560 --> 00:17:17.000
<i>That is the magic of friends</i>

00:17:15.030 --> 00:17:17.280
<i>The magic of friends?</i>

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:23.300
<i>If we join hands, our spirit will surge through us</i>

00:17:23.300 --> 00:17:29.710
<i>And we can all smile</i>

00:17:30.300 --> 00:17:33.500
Queens! You have three hearts as well!

00:17:33.980 --> 00:17:35.280
Believe!

00:17:53.160 --> 00:17:57.860
<i>A heart that believes was born
with the magic of friends.</i>

00:17:59.280 --> 00:18:00.210
<i>It's a miracle.</i>

00:18:03.980 --> 00:18:06.160
I don't even know what to say.

00:18:06.920 --> 00:18:08.170
That was pretty amazing.

00:18:08.170 --> 00:18:10.900
Yeah, that was exceptionally Kittyful.

00:18:10.900 --> 00:18:11.820
Kittyful?

00:18:12.130 --> 00:18:15.700
Senpai, what do I do?
I feel like I'm going to cry.

00:18:16.730 --> 00:18:18.320
It's all right to cry.

00:18:29.320 --> 00:18:31.970
They're sparkling.

00:18:38.230 --> 00:18:40.800
Hey, what the heck is Kittyful anyway?

00:18:41.060 --> 00:18:45.490
Kittyful is Kittyful and can't
be anything but Kittyful.

00:18:45.490 --> 00:18:46.850
I seriously don't get it.

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:51.090
So, Kittyful is, for example, when
you go to the cafeteria to eat lunch,

00:18:51.090 --> 00:18:52.100
and along the way—

00:18:51.690 --> 00:18:54.800
No, I've heard that already.

00:19:08.230 --> 00:19:09.180
Kouta?

00:19:11.600 --> 00:19:12.710
Kouta!

00:19:15.160 --> 00:19:16.830
Are you all right?

00:19:16.830 --> 00:19:19.510
You were doing this before, too.

00:19:19.510 --> 00:19:21.850
Huh? W-Was I?

00:19:25.930 --> 00:19:28.310
Or, it should be fun...

00:19:29.130 --> 00:19:32.630
Something feels like it's missing, though...

00:19:33.350 --> 00:19:35.360
Sorry, I can't really explain it.

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:38.290
I guess I was.

00:19:41.410 --> 00:19:44.530
You seem different to me 
compared to back then.

00:19:45.530 --> 00:19:48.250
Rather than feeling like
something is missing now,

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:50.050
you seem to be feeling irritated.

00:19:50.860 --> 00:19:52.870
Irritated?

00:19:53.470 --> 00:19:55.830
You know what it is but you
haven't realized it yet.

00:19:57.850 --> 00:20:02.900
I used to feel that way a lot when I was 
younger and taking tests in school.

00:20:03.700 --> 00:20:06.720
Could it be that you've already found it?

00:20:07.450 --> 00:20:09.390
What you think you want to do.

00:20:09.820 --> 00:20:12.230
What I want to do...?

00:20:21.020 --> 00:20:23.730
Goodness, what's the matter, Kouta?

00:20:30.800 --> 00:20:31.620
<i>That's it.</i>

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:35.380
<i>He's totally right.</i>

00:20:37.740 --> 00:20:39.750
<i>I found it when I was at Puroland!</i>

00:20:42.890 --> 00:20:45.260
The thing I want to do!

00:20:47.160 --> 00:20:52.180
That's why my heart is pounding
so hard in my chest.

00:20:54.700 --> 00:20:57.520
This is it! This is the feeling! Purin!

00:20:58.980 --> 00:21:01.940
Purin, I... I...

00:21:04.550 --> 00:21:07.150
Hey, do you think I can do it?

00:21:08.780 --> 00:21:13.380
<i>There is nothing you can't do, Kou-chan.</i>

00:21:20.070 --> 00:21:25.030
Grandma, I'm finally able
to admit that I like the things I do.

00:21:26.630 --> 00:21:29.190
That's why I'm definitely going to...

00:23:04.230 --> 00:23:08.240
Umm, Kouta? Sorry, can you run that by us again?

00:23:08.570 --> 00:23:09.460
Okay!

00:23:09.460 --> 00:23:11.480
I want to be like them!

00:23:11.480 --> 00:23:14.980
I want to be like Purin, Kitty, My Melody, 
Cinnamoroll, and Kiki and Lala!

00:23:16.630 --> 00:23:19.610
And... like all of you.

00:23:21.290 --> 00:23:22.850
I want to sparkle, too!

00:23:23.920 --> 00:23:25.540
Sparkle?

00:23:25.540 --> 00:23:27.430
Not Kiki and Lala?

00:23:27.430 --> 00:23:29.800
So, what do you want to do?

00:23:30.860 --> 00:23:31.660
Right!

00:23:32.580 --> 00:23:33.490
That's...

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.870
Next Episode

00:23:36.490 --> 00:23:38.840
Next time, "Sparkling Rhapsody".
